# LuxOS - sablona softwaru "Bezpecnost a site" (format viz everyday.list)
# Jen standardni nastroje z oficialnich repozitaru: analyza site a zabezpeceni systemu.
@name Security & Networking
@description Network analysis and system hardening: Nmap, Wireshark, firewall settings, a security audit and a password manager.
@apps Nmap · Wireshark · Gufw · Lynis · KeePassXC
@icon security-high
@groups wireshark
@order 50
@download 170
nmap
wireshark-qt
tcpdump
mtr
traceroute
bind
whois
openbsd-netcat
iperf3
gufw
lynis
arch-audit
keepassxc
